# RETURN
#═══════════════════════

scene black
with Dissolve(1.0)

pause 0.5

centered "{size=+15}Back to reality...{/size}"

scene University_Hallway_Back_Empty_Day
show black:
    alpha 0.9

centered "{size=+15}07:55 AM{/size}"

pause 1.0

scene University_Hallway_MC_Think_BG_Day
with fade

n "The memory slowly faded away."
n "The crowded hallway returned."
n "The voices, footsteps."
n "The noise of students moving from one class to another."
n "For a moment, it felt strange."
n "As if part of him was still sitting in that old room staring at those documents."

mc_thought "..."
mc_thought "No."
mc_thought "I'm not here to think about that."
mc_thought "Not today."

scene University_Hallway_MC_LS_BD_Day
with Fade(0.8, 0.5, 0.8)

n "He took a slow breath and adjusted the strap of his bag."

mc_thought "I came all the way here for a reason."
mc_thought "If I want answers...{w=0.5}Then I have to start somewhere."
mc_thought "And right now..."{w=0.5}That starts with surviving my first day."

scene University_Hallway_MC_LS_BU_Day

n "He picked up his pace and continued down the hallway."
n "The feeling of uncertainty hadn't disappeared."
n "But at least he was moving again."

scene University_Hallway_Secondary_Day

show MC Front Stand_Bag LS_BD:
    xpos 350
    ypos 270
    zoom 0.4

n "The university was larger than he expected."
n "Every hallway seemed connected to another."
n "Every turn revealed a place he hadn't seen before."

mc_thought "I should've looked at the map."
mc_thought "Or at least pretended I knew where I was going."

scene University_Hallway_Window_Day

show MC Front Stand_Bag LR_BD:
    xpos 800
    ypos 310
    zoom 0.4

n "As he walked, his attention drifted toward the tall windows lining the corridor."
n "Morning sunlight spilled across the floor and illuminated parts of the campus outside."

mc_thought "..."
mc_thought "I have to admit."
mc_thought "This place looks better than I expected."

n "For the first time since arriving, a small smile appeared on his face."
n "Maybe..."
n "Just maybe..."
n "Starting over wouldn't be as terrible as he imagined."

